<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Morton's rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Morton's rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it initiated coverage of Morton's Restaurant Group Inc with a buy-market outperforer rating.</p>
<p>-- projects annual earnings growth of 20 percent or more over the next three to five years.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $22.</p>
</text>
